#. Ready
#. Boot screen, shown while the product starts. Shown for a moment before the product opens.
msgid "boot.ready"
msgstr "Bereit"

#. You're offline
#. Boot screen, shown while the product starts. The product cannot start without a connection.
msgid "boot.offline.title"
msgstr "Sie sind offline"

#. Connect to the internet and try again.
#. Boot screen, shown while the product starts.
msgid "boot.offline.body"
msgstr "Stellen Sie eine Internetverbindung her und versuchen Sie es erneut."

#. Some content couldn't be downloaded. You can keep going with what's installed, or connect and try again.
#. Boot screen, shown while the product starts. Optional content is missing but the product can start.
msgid "boot.offline.playable"
