msgctxt "godot"
msgid "boot.continueOffline"
msgstr "Offline fortfahren"

#. macos: Continue Offline
msgctxt "macos"
msgid "boot.continueOffline"
msgstr "Offline fortfahren"

#. Content not downloaded
#. Boot screen, shown while the product starts. The person declined a required download.
msgid "boot.declined.title"
msgstr "Inhalte nicht heruntergeladen"

#. {product} needs this content to start. Download it when you're ready.
#. Boot screen, shown while the product starts. Arguments: {product} = the product's name from ProductIdentity (never translated).
msgid "boot.declined.body"
msgstr "{product} benötigt diese Inhalte zum Starten. Laden Sie sie herunter, wenn Sie bereit sind."

#. The last update didn't start, so the previous version was restored.
#. Boot screen, shown while the product starts. Shown once after an automatic rollback.
msgid "boot.rolledBack"
msgstr "Das letzte Update ließ sich nicht starten, daher wurde die vorherige Version wiederhergestellt."

