#. Boot screen, shown while the product starts. Arguments: {product} = the product's name from ProductIdentity (never translated); {size} = a byte size already formatted by the platform (“38 MB”).
msgid "boot.consent.body"
msgstr "{product} benötigt {size} an neuen Inhalten."

